<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>And when Thy touch of death is here and there</l><l>Laid on a thing most precious in mine eyes.</l><l>Let me not wonder, let me recognize</l><l>The answer to my prayer.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
